{"id":"solamente","lemma":"solamente","pos":"adv","rank":975,"glosses":["only, alone, merely"],"ipa":"/ˌsolaˈmente/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-solamente.wav","examples":[{"text":"Solamente un hombre sobrevivió.","en":"Only one man survived.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/459366"},{"text":"Solamente fingía estar durmiendo.","en":"She was only pretending to be asleep.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/735556"},{"text":"Tan solamente es demasiado pronto.","en":"It's just too soon.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/77377"},{"text":"Solamente robé unas pocas monedas.","en":"I only stole a few coins.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/851315"},{"text":"Leí solamente los tres primeros capítulos.","en":"I only read the first three chapters.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/552009"}]}